no tier condition. A day that completes only T2 partitions therefore raises `completed` without any T1 completion. With ten remaining T1 partitions and ten T2 completions on one observed day, line 177 returns `(10 * 1 + 10 - 1) // 10 = 1` day for the T1 work. The estimate is understated.\n\nMake the numerator use the same tier population as the denominator. Record T1 completions in the daily capacity record and read that field at line 174. Define the tier of a completed item with the same rule that selects the remaining T1 candidates.","id":"8d84d36688bb6a50a2a53e23308525c4786bf45733813d68db73698c1015088b","intervals":[[174,174]],"path":"apps/crq-python/backfill_report.py","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Count only T1 completions in the capacity estimate."}],"head":"ecb6df9c69de6b60f9fae0ec2af576f4f92a26f7","head_tree":"d16e28012af19cbe4667ce22a44fed8d3e652014","input_scope":[{"blob":"195990e8759943be253c8688f888607125e1af70","intervals":[[1,193]],"path":"apps/crq-python/backfill_report.py"},{"blob":"a32dc25d3a639bc038305497415915ca7fe238b5","intervals":[[1,176]],"path":"apps/crq-python/test_backfill_jobs.py"},{"blob":"efbb74817ad61e110c0edfe26e274f4f378c0fc4","intervals":[[1,267]],"path":"apps/crq-python/test_backfill_report.py"},{"blob":"847e1ca06da890ba7cb31c5c05ce7f0152119461","intervals":[[1,379]],"path":"apps/crq-python/test_repair_recovery.py"}],"job_id":"169b0749e5bc88e8024d28aeebd53ac03c034047cf9a01542d7948865759fd4e:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"195990e8759943be253c8688f888607125e1af70","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"apps/crq-python/backfill_report.py","reason":"bounded verified input"},{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"a32dc25d3a639bc038305497415915ca7fe238b5","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"apps/crq-python/test_backfill_jobs.py","reason":"bounded verified input"},{"baseline":{"metho